   "take": "Lance's record has gotten worse every single season: 9-3, then 7-7-1, then 5-5. Opened Year 3 with five straight wins and has dropped five straight since, the coldest current run in the house. Lives on laying points with Alabama as a security blanket, because the moment Lance takes points (0-2) or touches Texas, Indiana or Baylor (0-2 each), it goes up in smoke."
