  "micah": {
   "tag": "The House Donor",
   "take": "Three seasons, three losing records (4-8, 7-8, 3-7), and the worst all-time mark in the house by a damn mile. Laying points is a 2-8 shitshow and totals are 0-for-3, so the moneyline (8-4) is the only thing keeping Micah's account open. Just snapped a five-pick skid, which is about as good as it gets. Micah is 0-2 on USC, South Carolina, Kansas State, Alabama and Florida, so when Micah likes a big name, fade the hell out of it."
