   "take": "Best record in the house, but the résumé has holes. Year 1 Michael was a coin flip at 6-6, lowlighted by five straight losses. Still can't resist laying a monster number: Penn State -24.5 and Miami -20.5 both blew up. Miami and Texas A&M are 0-2 each, and the latest six-pick heater just died on Florida -5.5."
