   "take": "Two seasons, two winning records, but the misses are loud. Taking points is 1-3, and all three losses came with a double-digit cushion. Laid 32.5 with Ohio State and missed, then went back to the Buckeyes three weeks later and missed again. Noah keeps swinging for the fences and keeps whiffing on the same team."
